Cell["\<\
CompleteInfraEquilateralTriangle[graph, p1, p2] returns a List of unary \
InfraPoint[{c}] apex vertices equidistant from p1 and p2 at distance d(p1, \
p2) (Euclid I.1). With n / UpTo[n] / All controls multiplicity. Option: \
Method (\"Metric\" (default)).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"147f17fa-e65d-4b93-83bf-5c09fca5c11b"],

